   "titulo": "Invite",
   "texto": [
    "**Θέλεις να πάμε…;** means «You want us to go?». To accept: **Ναι, ευχαρίστως!** (Yes, enchanted!). To reject with education: **Συγγνώμη, δεν μπορώ** (I'm sorry, I can't).",
    "**Πότε;** asks when; **το Σάββατο** indicates Saturday. For one date, regular numbers are used in fixed expressions: **στις δέκα Μαΐου** (May 10)."
